{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>For we are destroying.</b> In every mission of the angels the singular form is used — שוב אשוב, ויאמר המלט — but here the plural form is used. Rather, since in the overturning we find the singular form — לבלתי הפכי — it could also use the plural form." "<b>And sent us.</b> Heavy stem (binyan) with dagesh. Even though every sending of messengers who return is written with וישלח in the light stem (kal) and raphe, here it is written in the heavy stem with dagesh, because it is a mission of destruction, like ושן בהמות אשלח בם, ישלח בם ערוב."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:52.297930411Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}